===Etymology 2===
In older slang, the term was more generally used of an older woman; its current meaning has probably been influenced by {{m|fi|lesbo}} (which starts with the same syllable). Originally the same word as etymology 1; compare the use of {{ncog|en|bat}} as a derogatory term for an old woman.

====Noun====
{{fi-noun}} {{tlb|fi|slang}}

# [[lesbian]], [[dyke]]
#: {{synonyms|fi|lesbo}}

